## diverged, matching
trunk  has diverged from local tracking ref  origin/trunk : 2 commits ahead, 5 commits behind.  origin/trunk  matched the remote when checked 2 min ago.

## diverged, differing
trunk  has diverged from local tracking ref  origin/trunk : 2 commits ahead, 5 commits behind.  origin/trunk  differs from the remote head observed 2 min ago; run git fetch origin to update local tracking refs.

## diverged, absent
trunk  has diverged from local tracking ref  origin/trunk : 2 commits ahead, 5 commits behind.  trunk  was absent on origin when checked 2 min ago.

## diverged, no answer
trunk  has diverged from local tracking ref  origin/trunk : 2 commits ahead, 5 commits behind. Remote state has not been verified.

## diverged, answer for main is not trunk's
trunk  has diverged from local tracking ref  origin/trunk : 2 commits ahead, 5 commits behind. Remote state has not been verified.

## missing tracking tip, usable present answer
